    "expectedRule": "Chapter 11 starts in the real phase. The first clear of a phase mirror (first, second, third) leaves a pending phase choice that blocks leaving with `镜城相位尚未指定，请先选择现实或镜像。`; law/resolve-mirror-city-phase keeps the phase for free or switches it for max(1, floor(maxHp x 10%)) HP, and with nothing pending is refused with `当前没有待指定的镜城相位。`. Max HP is derived from the build (the decoder recomputes it, so no HP is given as input): 50 + 14 x body 50 + patched_coat 10 = 760. A switch therefore costs 76. The first clear of real_anchor lights the real anchor only in the real phase and mirror_anchor lights the mirror anchor only in the mirror phase; a wrong-phase clear stays dark. Real phase: outgoing force +12%, art -6%; mirror phase: force -6%, art +12%. Display: title 镜海相位, status `<phase>相位，抉择 n/3，锚点 a/2`, `<phase>相位，待定相位，锚点 a/2` while pending, `<phase>相位，镜壳 r/t` once the boss started; severity danger while pending or with 2+ shells left, warning with 1 shell left or unresolved mirrors, resolved with both anchors or a started boss; meter {resolved, 3}. Selecting the boss snapshots the anchors and mints max(0, 2 - lit anchors) shells (no homecoming_prism); a damaging hit on the boss breaks one. Gates: mirror_city_real_relic_phase_lane needs the real phase (`仅现实相位可开启这条支路。`), mirror_city_real_anchor_survey_lane the real anchor, mirror_city_mirror_anchor_recharge_lane the mirror anchor (`需在镜像相位点亮镜像锚点。`), the boss approaches all three choices (`完成三处相位抉择后，镜王门才会显形。`). The pursuer is a separate run system and is disabled after entry so it cannot ambush the walk. All expected values are frozen here, never read from candidate code."
  },
